{"id":"u-b4650aa2-67cf-4ee5-941e-652fa5edda9c","src":"community","title":"The Iron Frequency 5-Day","author":"Bhavin S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/TfbbXD-the-efficient-5x5-matrix","desc":"maximize muscle hypertrophy and raw strength in under 50 minutes a day by stripped-down, ultra-efficient programming.\nIt solves the two biggest flaws of traditional workout routines:\n1. It eliminates the \"Bro Split\" trap: Instead of hitting a muscle group only once a week and making you wait 7 days to train it again, this template cleverly cross-pairs your exercises so every single muscle group is triggered exactly twice a week for optimal growth signal.\n2. It eliminates gym friction: By enforcing a strict \"one equipment style per block\" rule during the grueling finishers, you never have to waste time hogging multiple machines, cleaning off extra gear, or setting up complicated circuits. You walk in, dominate one heavy barbell or dumbbell station at a time, ignite a high-intensity metabolic burn, and walk out.","level":["Intermediate","Novice","Advanced"],"goals":["Olympic Weightlifting","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-09T20:04:43.251Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":20,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":60,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Push Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"